From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 11:01:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 736/743] perf(dsv41): select prefill_swizzle_panel=2 for M=64
 routed MoE GEMM

Honor swizzle_panel in grouped_fp8_fp4_gemm and set prefill_swizzle_panel=2 as
the default for M=64 prefill routed MoE grouped GEMM while keeping decode
(M=16) and mid (M=32) tiers at swizzle_panel=0.

Upstream-base: 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
Quality: exact bit parity with panel 0 across all 20 GPU equality cases and
38x2 paired screen cases; batch invariance verified on first 17 rows.
Tests: 24 native GPU pytest cases across 2 boots + 2-boot paired screen on DGX4.
---
